# The Ultimate Awesome List [![Awesome](https://awesome.re/badge-flat.svg)](https://awesome.re)
Every awesome list on every topic, including awesome lists of awesome lists, updated daily.

This list was generated automatically from [awesome.ecosyste.ms](https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/), an open API service indexing awesome lists of open source software. It includes every eligible awesome list with at least 30 items and a description. Within each section, lists are grouped by star count (1,000–9,999, 100–999, 10–99, and so on), highest groups first, then sorted alphabetically.

Last generated: <%= Time.now.strftime("%Y-%m-%d") %>, <%= @list_of_lists.length + @other_lists.length %> lists.

## Contents
- [Lists of Lists](#lists-of-lists)
- [Programming Language Lists](#programming-language-lists)
<% anchor_counts = Hash.new(0) %>
<% @languages.each do |lang| %>
<%   base_anchor = "#{lang.downcase.gsub(/[^a-z0-9\s-]/,'').gsub(' ','-')}-lists" %>
<%   anchor_counts[base_anchor] += 1 %>
<%   anchor = anchor_counts[base_anchor] > 1 ? "#{base_anchor}-#{anchor_counts[base_anchor] - 1}" : base_anchor %>
  - [<%= lang %> Lists](#<%= anchor %>)
<% end%>
<% if @topic_lists.any? %>
- [Topic Lists](#topic-lists)
<% @topic_lists.each_value do |group| %>
<%   base_anchor = "#{group[:name].downcase.gsub(/[^[:alnum:]\s_-]/, '').gsub(' ', '-')}-topic-lists" %>
<%   anchor_counts[base_anchor] += 1 %>
<%   anchor = anchor_counts[base_anchor] > 1 ? "#{base_anchor}-#{anchor_counts[base_anchor] - 1}" : base_anchor %>
  - [<%= group[:name] %> Topic Lists](#<%= anchor %>)
<% end %>
<% end %>
- [Other Lists](#other-lists)

## Lists of Lists

<% @list_of_lists.each do |list| %>
<%= "- [#{list.name}](#{list.url}) - #{list.awesome_description}" %>
<% end %>

## Programming Language Lists
<% @languages.each do |lang| %>
### <%= lang %> Lists
<% @other_lists.select{|l| l.primary_language == lang}.each do |list| %>
<%= "- [#{list.name}](#{list.url}) - #{list.awesome_description}" %>
<% end%>

<% end%>
<% if @topic_lists.any? %>
## Topic Lists

<% @topic_lists.each_value do |group| %>
### <%= group[:name] %> Topic Lists

<% group[:lists].each do |list| %>
<%= "- [#{list.name}](#{list.url}) - #{list.awesome_description}" %>
<% end %>

<% end %>
<% end %>
## Other Lists

<% @uncategorized_lists.each do |list| %>
<%= "- [#{list.name}](#{list.url}) - #{list.awesome_description}" %>
<% end %>
